							relative z-10 px-5
							lg:px-0
						 md:absolute md:inset-0 md:flex md:items-center md:justify-center"><div class="
							mx-auto flex max-w-[1000px] flex-col items-stretch
							text-left
							md:items-center md:justify-center md:text-center
						"><h1 class="mt-9 mb-6 font-display-large! mt-0!">Your <span class="text-white" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to top, var(--color-highlight) 80%, transparent 75%);background-size:100% 85%">data foundation</span> <br/>for production AI.</h1><div class="
								mt-0 w-full
								md:flex md:flex-col md:items-center
							"><p data-testid="hero-description-content" class="
											mb-5
											last-of-type:mb-0
										 font-body-lg! text-secondary mt-3 max-w-[700px]!">Everything your apps and AI agents need from data, unified and managed across any cloud. Always open source, so you&#x27;re never locked in.</p><div class="
										mt-7 flex flex-col justify-start gap-5
										md:mt-6 md:flex-row md:justify-center
