div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-name="cardList" class="border-b border-base"><div class="lg:section-padding"><div class="
						px-0
						lg:px-5
						xl:px-7
					 lg:border-base xl:border-x mx-auto max-w-container pt-layout3 pb-layout5 md:py-layout6 relative z-2 pb-0! px-0!"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="basis-4/12"><div class="
					mb-layout4 max-w-content padding-around
					md:mb-layout5
				 text-left lg:text-left lg:mx-0"><h2></h2><div class="mt-4"><h2 class="mt-5 mb-6">Aiven is the <span class="text-white" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to top, var(--color-highlight) 80%, transparent 75%);background-size:100% 85%">data cloud</span> for builders</h2><p class="
											mb-5
											last-of-type:mb-0
										 font-body-lg text-secondary">Most data infrastructure was built for analysts looking backward. Aiven is built for the people building what&#x27;s next - real apps and real agents, in production.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><article class="-mt-px flex-1 border-base md:max-lg:border-r lg:border-r"><div class="
					size-full bg-black
					light:bg-surface
				"><div class="
						group relative flex size-full flex-col
						border-t border-b border-base
					 overflow-hidden"><div class="h-[200px] overflow-hidden"><img aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" style="aspect-ratio:2" alt="Never get locked in illustration" class="size-full object-contain" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/sczeoy4w/production/43940d883421653fbf94f1ebd3acb9b06825d208-800x400.png?q=80&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=1.5" title="" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/sczeoy4w/production/43940d883421653fbf94f1ebd3acb9b06825d208-800x400.png?w=400&amp;q=80&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=1.5 400w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/sczeoy4w/production/43940d883421653fbf94f1ebd3acb9b06825d208-800x400.png?w=600&amp;q=80&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=1.5 600w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/sczeoy4w/production/43940d883421653fbf94f1ebd3acb9b06825d208-800x400.png?w=800&amp;q=80&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=1.5 800w" sizes="(min-width:768px) 300px, 50vw"/></div><div class="flex-1 padding-around"><div class="mb-3"><p class="font-heading-sm! text-primary">Never get locked in</p></div><div class=""><p class="font-body-md! text-secondary">Genuine open source on open standards and formats. Your data, apps and teams stay portable - you could leave anytime, which is why you won&#x27;t need to.</p></div></div></div></div></article><article class="-mt-px flex-1 border-base lg:border-r"><div class="
					size-full bg-black
					light:bg-surface
				"><div class="
						group relative flex size-full flex-col
						border-t border-b border-base
					 overflow-hidden"><div class="h-[200px] overflow-hidden"><img aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" style="aspect-ratio:2" alt="The right tool, none of the ops illustration" class="size-full object-contain" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/sczeoy4w/production/a66ac4e36b6a2427f4117c2a56a39cf249548b50-800x400.png?q=80&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=1.5" title="" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/sczeoy4w/production/a66ac4e36b6a2427f4117c2a56a39cf249548b50-800x400.png?w=400&amp;q=80&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=1.5 400w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/sczeoy4w/production/a66ac4e36b6a2427f4117c2a56a39cf249548b50-800x400.png?w=600&amp;q=80&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=1.5 600w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/sczeoy4w/production/a66ac4e36b6a2427f4117c2a56a39cf249548b50-800x400.png?w=800&amp;q=80&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=1.5 800w" sizes="(min-width:768px) 300px, 50vw"/></div><div class="flex-1 padding-around"><div class="mb-3"><p class="font-heading-sm! text-primary">The right tool, none of the ops</p></div><div class=""><p class="font-body-md! text-secondary">The best tool for each workload, with patching, scaling, security and uptime handled. Ship instead of maintaining.</p></div></div></div></div></article><article class="-mt-px flex-1 border-base md:max-lg:border-r lg:border-r"><div class="
					size-full bg-black
					light:bg-surface
				"><div class="
