						 relative mx-auto md:w-[40%] md:text-left lg:px-7"><div class="flex flex-col gap-5"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-x-2 rounded-full text-center font-medium duration-200 ease-in-out disabled:pointer-events-none bg-primary-green-40 text-black no-underline hover:bg-primary-green-30 hover:text-grey-80 active:bg-primary-green-40 active:text-black/50 disabled:bg-grey-30 disabled:text-grey-40 light:bg-primary-teal-40 light:hover:bg-primary-teal-50 light:active:bg-primary-teal-40 min-h-[48px] px-5 py-3 text-sm w-full" href="https://console.aiven.io/signup"><div class="inline-flex size-full items-center justify-center gap-3"><span class="">Get building</span></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><!--/$--></main><footer role="contentinfo" class="relative overflow-hidden text-white"><div class="lg:section-padding"><div class="
