1\":93,\"_94\":1746,\"_96\":1747},\"a75310e3277b\",[],\"Data, governance, agent access and runtime in one open architecture, so agents can find, trust, reach and act on your data.\",{\"_648\":-5,\"_649\":650,\"_651\":1749,\"_653\":1750},\"homepage card04.png\",\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/sczeoy4w/production/58dc99e463f78f81c7c321ac28c1f2b7cfa7287f-800x400.png\",\"‎ \",{\"_21\":102,\"_105\":68,\"_106\":-5,\"_36\":-5,\"_38\":1767},{\"_82\":-5,\"_83\":1764},[1756],\"Run where it makes sense\",{\"_60\":1757,\"_21\":81,\"_82\":-5,\"_83\":-5,\"_84\":1758,\"_86\":1759,\"_88\":141},\"a7e56f089c14\",[1760],[],{\"_60\":1761,\"_21\":93,\"_94\":1762,\"_96\":1763},\"64ec5fd8e2af\",[],\"One control plane across AWS, GCP, Azure and BYOC. Choose by cost, latency, and residency, not where a vendor requires.\",{\"_648\":-5,\"_649\":650,\"_651\":1765,\"_653\":1766},\"homepage card03.png\",\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/sczeoy4w/production/fbc561921226931f1554bc488cc3dc58895845d8-800x400.png\",\"‎\",{\"_82\":-5,\"_83\":1779},[1771],\"The right tool, none of the ops\",{\"_60\":1772,\"_21\":81,\"_82\":-5,\"_83\":-5,\"_84\":1773,\"_86\":1774,\"_88\":141},\"f998d03506ed\",[1775],[],{\"_60\":1776,\"_21\":93,\"_94\":1777,\"_96\":1778},\"c34d48e46434\",[],\"The best tool for each workload, with patching, scaling, security and uptime handled. Ship instead of maintaining.\",{\"_648\":-5,\"_649\":650,\"_651\":1780,\"_653\":1781},\"homepage card02.png\",\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/sczeoy4w/production/a66ac4e36b6a2427f4117c2a56a39cf249548b50-800x400.png\",{\"_21\":102,\"_105\":68,\"_106\":-5,\"_36\":-5,\"_38\":1767},{\"_82\":-5,\"_83\":1794},[1786],\"Never get locked in\",{\"_60\":1787,\"_21\":81,\"_82\":-5,\"_83\":-5,\"_84\":1788,\"_86\":1789,\"_88\":141},\"0a60321bad36\",[1790],[],{\"_60\":1791,\"_21\":93,\"_94\":1792,\"_96\":1793},\"48aadb3e79d1\",[],\"Genuine open source on open standards and formats. Your data, apps and teams stay portable - you could leave anytime, which is why you won