					 overflow-hidden" href="/webinar/your-data-says-one-thing-your-ai-thinks-another" data-discover="true"><div class="flex-1 padding-around"><div class="mb-3"><p class="font-heading-sm! text-primary">Your Data Says One Thing. Your AI Thinks Another.</p></div><div class=""><p class="font-body-md! text-secondary">AI agents don&#x27;t reconcile messy product data, they act on it. Aiven + SFEIR show Retail + CPG teams how to build a governed foundation their agents can actually trust.</p></div><div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-3"><svg height="15" width="11" viewBox="0 0 11 15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="text-primary-green" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="m3.20345 1.43369.03096.02064 6.57222 4.38149c.00932.00621.01866.01244.02802.01867.18405.12266.37405.24926.52365.36987.1587.12805.3839.33456.516.65307.1653.39854.1653.84644 0 1.24498-.1321.3185-.3573.52501-.516.65307-.1496.12061-.3396.2472-.52364.36986-.00936.00624-.0187.01246-.02803.01868L3.20344 13.5661c-.22546.1504-.44814.2989-.6416.4038-.19341.1048-.51513.2578-.90869.2343-.47429-.0283-.912439-.2628-1.199096-.6417-.237857-.3145-.288984-.667-.309056-.8861-.020078-.2191-.020036-.4868-.019994-.7578.000002-.0124.000004-.0248.000004-.0372V3.11844c0-.01241-.000002-.02481-.000004-.03721-.000042-.27101-.000084-.53866.019994-.7578.020072-.21906.071199-.57164.309056-.88606.286657-.37893.724806-.613421 1.199096-.64174.39356-.023499.71528.129536.90869.23435.19347.10485.41615.25335.64161.40371ZM2.12501 3.11843v8.76297l6.57222-4.38148-6.57222-4.38149Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><p class="font-body text-xs md:text-sm leading-[1.55] -tracking-[.25px] font-normal text-primary whitespace-pre-line"><span>Sep 30, 2026</span></p></div><ul class="mb-5 mt-3 mb-0!"><div class="inline-flex h-fit items-center rounded-full border leading-none border-deep-blue-40 bg-deep-blue-90 text-primary light:border-deep-blue-40 light:bg-deep-blue-0 light:text-deep-blue-60 px-3 py-2 font-label