						lg:sticky lg:top-24 lg:border-r-0 lg:border-b-0
					"><h2 class="font-heading-xl!">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div class="
						col-span-1 flex h-full flex-col justify-end
						lg:border-l lg:border-base
					 lg:col-span-2"><div class="flex h-full flex-col" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="
								border-base px-5
